## Pay Equity Analysis

### Methodology
- Analyzed by level, function, location, tenure
- Controlled for legitimate factors
- Conducted by third-party firm (Syndio)

### Results (2024)

| Group | Pay Equity Ratio |
|-------|-----------------|
| Women vs. Men | 99.2% |
| URM vs. Non-URM | 98.8% |

**Actions Taken**:
- 42 salary adjustments made to close gaps
- Total investment: $485,000
- Quarterly monitoring implemented

